The rows are exact covers of the required endpoints. The window forces
catalogue row 291 and rules out every other index above 258. We branch
on the row covering an allowed point, excluding intersecting rows in
the same group and rows intersecting in two points across groups.
The search uses groups 0 and 9 through 14. -/

